<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : Minuteman</h1>
<a name="toc_tc64020"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4121: Verify User is able to View &quot;Minuteman Calc.&quot; Card&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 2]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify User is able to View "Minuteman Calc." Card</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on Home page provided user is given permission to view the Minuteman</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Verify user is login to Mobile application as Customer user</td><td>User should be on home page</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Verify User is displayed with Minuteman Card on home level</td><td>Minuteman card on home level should be displayed.</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Verify both web and mobile minuteman card count should be in sync</td><td>Minuteman card count that is displayed on web should display the same count on the mobile in home page</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify user view a conveyor and check Minuteman Calc  card displayed</td><td>Minuteman Calc card should be displayed on Conveyor level</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify user view a conveyor which has minuteman calculation</td><td>Minuteman card count that is displayed on web conveyor level should display the same count on the mobile in conveyor level.</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">Minuteman:  Generic Requirement [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc64027"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4122: Verify User should not display the &quot;Minuteman Calc.&quot; Card when view permission is not given&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 3]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
