</td><td><p>Only Minuteman Conveyor calculation should be displayed and only conveyor calculation count&nbsp;should be displayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Verify user provide only view permission for Minuteman Elevator&nbsp;calculation</p>
